<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CBT STARTED AS &quot;RECOMMENDED&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CBT STARTED AS &quot;RECOMMENDED&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Dublin-based software company CBT Corp on its &quot;recommended list&quot;, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
